{"text": "Congresswoman Sue Myrick\n\nMarch 9, 2010\n\nDear Friend,\n\n| would like to extend an invitation to ACT! for America members and their friends and\nfarnily to join me at ACT! for America\u2019s 2010 National Conference and Legislative Briefing.\n\nAs many of you know, I am the founder and Co-Chair of the Anti-Terrorism Caucus in\nthe U.S. House of Representatives. I am gravely concerned about the many ways Islamism\nthreatens America\u2019s national security.\n\nThat\u2019s why I am thrilled at the growth and progress ACT! for America is enjoying.\nSpeaking as a Member of Congress, let me assure you, your voice does matter up here, and your\nvoice is even more potent when it\u2019s part of a bigger organization like ACT! for America!\n\nLast year I was honored to be invited to address the ACT! for America members who\nattended its legislative briefing here in Washington. I joined a dozen of my colleagues, members\nof both the House and the Senate, in sharing our understanding, insights and concerns about a\nbroad range of issues related to the threat of Islamism.\n\nI was impressed by the caliber of the ACT! for America attendees and their passionate\nconcern for the future of our nation. I was deeply moved to receive ACT! for America\u2019s\n\u201cNational Security Patriot Award,\u201d and so proud to be together with a group of patriotic people\nwho love their country as you all do.\n\nThis year | understand that ACT! for America has expanded this event to not only include\nthe legislative briefing, but a full day conference, a Welcome Reception, and a Gala Banquet. I\nam thrilled to be invited again and, schedule permitting, | plan on being with you again this year.\n\nKnowing ACT! for America as | do, and its leadership team beginning with Brigitte\nGabriel and Guy Rodgers, I have no doubt that this conference will be a first-class event you\n\nwon't want to miss.\n\nSincerely,\n\nCongresswomary Sue Myrick\n\nNN POU ES PN RR EAN RAS RN VASO mane",
